description:
Get the latest posts from the sites you follow, as shown on your Nekoweb feed. Posts come from those sites' RSS feeds: each has a title, link, site, date and short description.

Requires the optional session token (NEKOWEB_SESSION_TOKEN). If it isn't set, this tool returns setup steps to pass on to the user.

Newest posts are on page 1. For posts from all of Nekoweb, use nekoweb_get_global_feed, which needs no session token.

Examples:
  - "What did the sites I follow post lately?" -> {}
  - "Older posts from my feed" -> { page: 2 }
